{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Cabinetry_Header-hero.webp" alt="All Wood Cabinets" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>Kitchen Design</h1><h2>From Singer Kitchens serving metro New Orleans &amp; the Northshore</h2><div class="el-text"><p>If you’re like most metro New Orleans families, your kitchen is the heart of your home. It’s where you make red beans and rice on Monday nights, cook up a pot of jambalaya for a big family meal, and make a batch of gumbo for Saints or LSU parties on weekends.</p><p>If you’ve ever wanted to see what a brand new kitchen might look like, we offer thoughtful kitchen design renderings for customers in New Orleans, Mandeville, Covington &amp; the entire metro areas.</p><p>Not only can we help you design your kitchen, we have the cabinets, countertops &amp; appliances you need. Plus, our team can do the renovation work itself so there’s no need for an outside contractor.</p><p><a href="/showrooms/">Visit a showroom near you</a> or <a href="/request-consultation/">contact us online</a> to find out more!</p></div><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2020/04/remodeling-checklist-cta-banner.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Checklist, download now" width="800" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>“I'm so pleased with the end result!”</p></div><p class="el-sub">Karen B. New Orleans</p></div><div class="el-col"><div class="gallery gallery-grid"><figure><img src="/images/2018/05/801Frenchman7New.webp" alt="Kitchen island with a turned wood column beside a black door" width="1200" height="801" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img src="/images/2018/05/801Frenchman2New.webp" alt="Historic kitchen with a black range hood, open shelves and arched windows" width="1016" height="636" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img src="/images/2018/05/801Frenchman1New.webp" alt="Open historic kitchen with tall arched windows, wood floors and a crystal chandelier" width="703" height="469" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><h2>Your One-Stop-Shop for Your Dream Kitchen</h2><div class="el-text"><p>To some homeowners, the thought of overseeing a kitchen remodel is daunting. But with our products and services, we make remodeling your kitchen a breeze.</p>
<p>We offer all the products you need for your kitchen remodel, including:<br>
<ul><br>
 	<li><a href="/countertops/">Countertop</a> options such as granite, quartz, and laminate</li><br>
 	<li><a href="/cabinets/">Cabinetry</a> options, including those with the extremely popular farmhouse look, as well as all the necessary accessories including hinges and doorknobs</li><br>
 	<li><a href="/appliances/">Kitchen appliances</a> including stoves, refrigerators, dishwashers, microwaves, and garbage disposals from nationwide leading name brands such as KitchenAid, Whirlpool, GE Appliances, GE Monogram, Amana, Frigidaire, Broan, Vent-A-Hood, Sharp, and Waste King</li><br>
 	<li>In-house renovation contractors you can trust, so you don’t have to work with both a separate vendor and contractor or worry about your contractor not showing up or doing a good job</li><br>
</ul></p>
<p>As you can see, we offer everything you need for your kitchen remodel so you only need to work with one vendor for all your kitchen remodel products and contracting services.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Kitchen Gallery</h2><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><div class="gallery gallery-grid"><figure><img src="/images/2018/03/marquee8.webp" alt="Cream kitchen with an island, dark countertops and a stainless range" width="620" height="510" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img src="/images/2018/03/marquee2.webp" alt="Frameless European Cabinets" width="620" height="510" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img src="/images/2018/03/marquee4.webp" alt="Kitchen with Island" width="620" height="510" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><figure><img src="/images/2018/03/marquee2a.webp" alt="Kitchen with a carved range hood, cream cabinets and a granite island" width="620" height="510" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div><div class="el-col"><div class="before-after"><figure><img src="/images/2019/02/After_SliderPic.webp" alt="Before: Kitchen Design New Orleans, Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Before</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/2019/02/Before_SliderPic1.webp" alt="After: Kitchen Design New Orleans, Mandeville, Covington &amp; Slidell" width="1195" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>After</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><h2>We Offer 0% Financing for Qualifying Homeowners</h2><div class="el-text"><p>With our <a href="/financing/">3 special 0% financing options</a>,  your dream kitchen is closer than ever to becoming a reality. Depending on your credit situation, you may qualify for 12 months, 24 months, or even 60 months of financing at 0% interest!</p>
<p>Applying for our financing options is easy. Simply download and fill out a credit application, submit it by either scanning a copy of it or taking a photo of it and sending it to us electronically, and if you’re approved, select your financing terms from your available options.</p></div><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2020/02/Picture1.webp" alt="0% interest financing available, request an estimate" width="599" height="416" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Visit Our New Orleans or Northshore Showroom to See Our Kitchen Remodeling Products in Person</h2><div class="el-text"><p>While it can be fun to search web galleries of kitchen remodeling products, an online gallery can only demonstrate so much. The best way to truly experience our available products and imagine how they’ll look in your new kitchen is to come visit us at one of our <a href="/showrooms/">showrooms</a>. We have convenient locations for Metro New Orleans and Northshore homeowners, with showrooms located in New Orleans and Mandeville.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>New Orleans</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=231%20N.%20Carrollton%20Ave%2C%20New%20Orleans&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 231 N. Carrollton Ave, New Orleans" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p>231 N. Carrollton Ave.<br>(at Bienville, across from Brocato's)<br>New Orleans, LA 70119<br>(504) 486-0067<br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-6pm, Sat 10am-3pm</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Mandeville​</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=316%20Girod%20St%20Mandeville%2C%20LA%2070448&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 316 Girod St Mandeville, LA 70448" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p>316 Girod St.<br>(Old Mandeville)<br>Mandeville, LA 70448<br>(985) 778-2978<br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-6pm, Sat 10am-3pm</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Free Estimates and Design Rendering</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We know that you may have an idea of what you want your dream kitchen to look like, but that you aren’t necessarily a contractor or architect. Don’t worry! Our services include free design rendering, so we can take your feedback, create a design, and then show you digitally what your new kitchen will look like.</p><p>Additionally, we offer New Orleans and Northshore homeowners with free, no-obligation estimates. Call on us to estimate the cost of your new kitchen, and let us prove our value to you!</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Contact Us Today to Make Your Dream Kitchen a Reality</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We’re ready to help you every step of the way with your upcoming kitchen remodel. Whether you’d like to browse our products in our showroom, speak with a design consultant, or get a free estimate, we’re here for you. Simply call us at (504) 608-4982, <a href="/showrooms/">visit one of our showrooms</a>, or fill out our online form to <a href="/request-consultation/">schedule a free consultation</a>.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2020/04/remodeling-checklist-cta-banner.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Checklist, download now" width="800" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div></section>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/process-strip.njk" %}{% raw %}{% endraw %}
